{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "U1: Implement the 'runtime info' feature by exposing Spring Boot Actuator's `/info` and `/env` endpoints, and create a custom shell command (e.g., using Spring Shell) to format and display this data for the specified module.",
    "U2: Leverage the existing Spring Cloud Data Flow Server and its deployment mechanism. Implement a new deployer module using the Spring Cloud Deployer SPI specifically for Apache YARN. This will involve creating a `YarnDeployer` class that handles application lifecycle on YARN.",
    "U3: The 'file' module (assumed to be a Source module) will be ported from the Spring XD repository to the Spring Cloud Stream Module repository. This involves moving the code, updating dependencies to align with Spring Cloud Stream conventions (e.g., using `Supplier`, `Function`, `Consumer` interfaces), and ensuring it builds and tests correctly within the new project structure.",
    "U4: Refactor the Maven build of the Spring Cloud Data Flow project. This involves restructuring the multi-module Maven POM to allow individual SPI deployer modules (like the hypothetical YARN deployer) to be built, tested, and versioned independently of the admin server module.",
    "U5: Perform a targeted code cleanup to remove the custom `XDRuntimeException` class and all its usages. This requires replacing it with appropriate standard Spring or Java exceptions (e.g., `IllegalStateException`, `DataAccessException`) and ensuring error handling remains consistent.",
    "U6: Update the GemFire sink module dependency in the Spring Cloud Stream module parent POM or BOM (Bill of Materials) to reference the latest stable release version. Verify compatibility and run integration tests.",
    "U7: Locate, prepare, and publish the SFTP source module. This involves ensuring the module's source code is present (possibly porting it from XD or an existing location), configuring its Maven build to produce a standard Spring Cloud Stream module artifact, and publishing it to the specified Maven repository (`libs-snapshot`).",
    "U8: Enhance the CI/CD pipelines (assumed to be Jenkins, GitLab CI, or similar) for the Data Flow project. This includes adding stages for: building the newly modularized deployers (U4), running integration tests against a live Data Flow server, and potentially publishing snapshot artifacts of the ported/updated modules (U6, U7)."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The 's-c-d' in user stories refers to 'Spring Cloud Data Flow'. The 'XD' refers to the legacy 'Spring XD' project.",
    "The development environment is a standard Java 17+ environment with Maven/Gradle, and access to required repositories (GitHub, Maven Central, Spring repos).",
    "The team has existing familiarity with the Spring ecosystem, Spring Cloud Data Flow, and Spring Cloud Stream.",
    "The placeholders `{{runtime info}}`, `{{host}}`, `{{port}}`, `{{file}}`, `{{source}}`, `{{admin}}`, `{{XDRuntimeException}}`, `{{gemfire}}`, and `{{module list}}` refer to specific, concrete implementation details within the Spring Cloud Data Flow codebase (e.g., `RuntimeEnvironmentInfo`, `server.port`, the `File` source module, the Admin Server, etc.).",
    "The 'SFTP source module' and 'gemfire sink' module code already exist in some form (e.g., in a different repository or an older version) and primarily need porting, dependency updates, and publication.",
    "The CI pipeline infrastructure (e.g., Jenkins servers, agents) is already in place and operational. The work is to enhance the pipeline configuration scripts (e.g., Jenkinsfile, .gitlab-ci.yml).",
    "All work is for a single developer, so effort is purely the sum of individual tasks without overhead for coordination or context switching."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "A1",
      "activity_name": "Implement Runtime Info Shell Command (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Design and implement a Spring Shell command to display module runtime details (host, port, etc.) by querying Spring Boot Actuator endpoints. Includes coding the command, adding necessary dependencies, and writing unit/integration tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A2",
      "activity_name": "Develop YARN Deployer Module (U2)",
      "activity_description": "Create a new deployer module implementing the Spring Cloud Deployer SPI for YARN. This includes writing the `YarnDeployer` class, configuration properties, YARN client interaction logic, and comprehensive unit tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 40
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A3",
      "activity_name": "Port 'File' Source Module (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Migrate the 'File' source module code from the Spring XD repository to the Spring Cloud Stream module repository. Refactor interfaces to Spring Cloud Stream style, update Maven POM, and ensure the module builds and passes tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A4",
      "activity_name": "Refactor Build for Independent Deployer Modules (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Restructure the Maven multi-module build of the Data Flow project. Create separate parent POMs or profiles to allow each SPI deployer (including the new YARN one) to be built, tested, and released independently of the main admin server.",
      "most_likely_effort": 32
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5",
      "activity_name": "Remove XDRuntimeException (U5)",
      "activity_description": "Locate and remove the custom `XDRuntimeException` class and all its throw sites. Replace with standard Spring/Java exceptions. Refactor related error handling and update tests to verify correct exception propagation.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A6",
      "activity_name": "Update GemFire Sink to Latest Release (U6)",
      "activity_description": "Update the dependency version for the GemFire sink module in the relevant Maven configuration. Verify the build succeeds with the new version and run a basic integration test to confirm functionality.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A7",
      "activity_name": "Add and Publish SFTP Source Module (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Ensure the SFTP source module code is available in the Spring Cloud Stream module repository. Configure its Maven build correctly, and execute the build and publication to the specified snapshot Maven repository (`libs-snapshot`).",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A8",
      "activity_name": "Enhance CI Pipelines (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Update the project's CI/CD pipeline configuration to add stages for: building the modularized deployers, running integration tests against a live server instance, and potentially publishing snapshot artifacts of the updated/ported modules.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 168
  }
}
